    "purpose": "UI-friendly, metadata-driven result-format model for the dynamic result card. Derived from 03-docs/04-game-result-format-inventory.md + reference-tables/game.csv. The UI renders balls from this metadata; it never hardcodes a fixed ball count and never parses raw feed XML.",
