    "colorTokensNote": "colorToken values are semantic names only. Final colors are NOT decided yet. sourceCssClass records the legacy CSS class from ResultFormat_Upgrade.properties where known (see 04-doc); null = not yet confirmed. Do not treat these as final hex colors.",
